Target Flow

ADMIN creates managed token mints.
MAKER creates mint or transfer requests.
CHECKER approves or rejects requests.
After approval, the required on-chain action is signed in the browser by the correct role wallet.
Backend records status, signatures, explorer links, and audit logs, but does not depend on server-held maker/checker keys for normal user flows.
